//- NoteFragment.js
// `ISub` implements the enabled `Spec`, whose client field `note` the server
// type `FrequencySpec` serves as a server field. The server makes
// `FrequencySpec` implement `ISub` without listing `Spec`, which Relay accepts:
// the incremental build gives `note` a `FrequencySpec` case, as a full build
// does.
graphql`fragment NoteFragment on Spec {
  note
}`

